            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Patrick Pugh"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Unbalanced recipe that I don't think can be fixed. Find a really good peanut sauce recipe and use that instead. This recipe is nothing but sweetened peanut butter on bland green beans. \n\nSkip it.",
