          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "1"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JulieAnn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Unless you really love peanut butter (and I mean like my puppy!) and really DON'T like the taste of green beans, you will probably not like this as is. You might as well just get out a jar of peanut butter and shove the green beans in it. It overwhelmed any other ingredients. I added more soy sauce, I added more miso paste, I then tries resorting to tons of fresh grated ginger, then cayenne, but I did not care for this recipe. Maybe it's just me but....",
            "datePublished": "2011-04-30T13:10:32.857Z"
          }
